+## 10. 售后/退货退款推送（`/open/v1/retail/aftersales/sync`）
+
+淘系售后退款由奇门推送到本接口；非淘系由后端定时用聚水潭售后接口拉取，无需推送。
+
+```
+POST http://120.237.174.243:6479/open/v1/retail/aftersales/sync
+Content-Type: application/json
+（无需 Authorization）
+```
+
+### 10.1 可接受的请求体
+
+按优先级自动识别，下列任一形式均可：
+
+| 形式 | 示例 |
+| --- | --- |
+| 奇门原始返回 | `{"code":0,"data":{"datas":[...]}}` |
+| 只传数组 | `{"after_sales":[...]}` / `{"aftersales":[...]}` / `{"refunds":[...]}` |
+| 聚水潭原样 | `{"data":{"page_index":1,"has_next":false,"datas":[...]}}` |
+| 裸数组 | `[{...},{...}]` |
+| 单张售后单 | `{...}`（含 `as_id`/`outer_as_id`） |
+
+低代码平台把数组序列化成字符串也能识别（`"{{632.aftersales}}"` → JSON 字符串）。
+
+### 10.2 最小可用报文
+
+```json
+{
+  "source": "qimen",
+  "request_id": "qimen-as-20261027-0001",
+  "after_sales": [
+    {
+      "as_id": "900000001",
+      "outer_as_id": "RF2026102400001",
+      "so_id": "TB2026102400001",
+      "o_id": "880000001",
+      "shop_id": 900001,
+      "shop_name": "示例旗舰店",
+      "type": "退货退款",
+      "status": "Confirmed",
+      "as_date": "2026-10-20 10:12:00",
+      "modified": "2026-10-22 09:30:11",
+      "confirm_date": "2026-10-22 09:30:00",
+      "refund": 199.0,
+      "payment": 0,
+      "free_amount": 5.0,
+      "freight": 0,
+      "buyer_paid_amount": 199.0,
+      "seller_income_amount": 189.05,
+      "remark": "尺码不合适",
+      "items": [
+        {
+          "asi_id": "900000011",
+          "sku_id": "SKU-DEMO-001",
+          "name": "铝合金外壳 示例款",
+          "qty": 1,
+          "r_qty": 1,
+          "price": 199.0,
+          "amount": 199.0
+        }
+      ]
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+必填：`as_id` 或 `outer_as_id` 至少一个（唯一键）；其余字段缺失按 null 落库。
+
+### 10.3 金额与期间口径
+
+```
+实退金额 actual_refund = freight + refund - payment - free_amount
+期间 period_value     = as_date → created → modified → confirm_date 中第一个可用时间的 YYYY-MM
+```
+
+### 10.4 响应
+
+```json
+{
+  "code": 0,
+  "msg": "零售售后单同步完成",
+  "data": {
+    "batch_id": "as-push-20261027153000123456",
+    "request_id": "qimen-as-20261027-0001",
+    "duplicate": false,
+    "received": 1,
+    "created": 1,
+    "updated": 0,
+    "unchanged": 0,
+    "stale": 0,
+    "failed": 0,
+    "item_count": 1,
+    "periods": ["2026-10"],
+    "errors": []
+  },
+  "status_code": 200,
+  "success": true
+}
+```
+
+| 字段 | 含义 |
+| --- | --- |
+| `duplicate` | 同一 `X-Request-ID`/`request_id` 或同一份 body 重复提交时为 `true`，返回首次结果 |
+| `created/updated/unchanged` | 新增 / 内容变更 / 内容一致 |
+| `stale` | 上游 `modified` 比库里旧，已跳过 |
+| `failed` + `errors[]` | 单条失败原因（不阻断整批） |
+
+### 10.5 curl 自测
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST "http://120.237.174.243:6479/open/v1/retail/aftersales/sync" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -H "X-Request-ID: as-test-20261027-001" \
+  --data-binary @deploy/retail-aftersale-20261027/test_aftersale_sync.json
+```
+
+### 10.6 管理端查看
+
+页面 **开放接口 → 零售订单同步 → 退款售后**：按期间/店铺/售后单号/订单号/类型筛选，
+点「明细」看 SKU 与金额；右上「同步聚水潭售后」可手动拉取非淘系售后（权限
+`module_retail:shop:sync`，查询权限 `module_retail:order:query`）。
